Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.66,0:00:15.25,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Good grief. He sure went\N and did something unnecessary.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.45,0:00:20.00,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,He's a fool who can't see the big picture.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.75,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Afurisitul de Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.75,0:00:28.80,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Getting involved in the power struggle between\Ndemon realm factions is already unforgivable,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.34,0:00:34.51,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,but he actually united them.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.10,0:00:40.40,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,There's Jin, too. Both parent and child \Nare taking too much into their own hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.40,0:00:45.57,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Regardless, this is a grave matter\N that threatens the hero village's survival.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.57,0:00:49.57,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,We need careful consideration\N on how to proceed.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.57,0:00:51.07,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.07,0:00:54.45,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Any who would harm our duty, \Nno matter who they may be...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.70,0:01:00.12,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,We certainly can't afford \Nto overlook this any longer.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.29,0:01:06.80,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,If he is going to bring \Nabout calamity again, then...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.72,0:01:16.64,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,How's this, Basara-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.14,0:01:17.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.81,0:01:20.44,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Oh, well, it does feel good.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.31,0:01:24.73,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Am I bothering you, Basara-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.23,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.61,0:01:28.99,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.98,0:01:43.33,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Enough moaning, Zest!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.33,0:01:44.63,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.13,0:01:49.21,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.42,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Yuki-san and Kurumi-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.01,0:01:54.93,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What're you three wearing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.93,0:02:00.39,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,W-Well, Maria said you'd enjoy this more.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.90,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What nonsense is that horny\Nloli-succubus spouting now?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.23,0:02:06.98,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,There you have it, Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.98,0:02:09.94,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,So we'll be washing you, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.03,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.26,0:02:37.30,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,"Naughty Bath Time with Sexy Beauties..."
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.30,0:02:41.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another gem has been added\Nto my treasured collection!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.93,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Listen, you!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.94,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,How is it, Basara?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.94,0:02:47.98,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,D-Does it feel good?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.69,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.57,0:02:51.48,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It does?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.69,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.07,0:02:53.99,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.66,0:03:01.45,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,Henceforth we will fundamentally \Nhave no interaction with you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.50,0:03:05.12,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,With a military alliance\Ncurrently being formed
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.12,0:03:08.21,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,between us and the reigning\Ndemon-lord faction,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.21,0:03:10.92,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,we must avoid provoking useless \Nsuspicion and speculation
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.92,0:03:15.22,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,that would come from making \Ncontact with you without cause.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.76,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.76,0:03:21.22,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,You can't let go of the peace \Nyou've finally obtained.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.68,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,That's all there is to discuss.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.68,0:03:26.31,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,You should return to your world.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.36,0:03:33.11,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Are you planning to bid farewell \Nto Mio without saying anything?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.15,0:03:35.24,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Wilbert-san!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.07,0:03:39.49,Dialogue Flashback,Rukia,0,0,0,,Basara-dono.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.78,0:03:44.75,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,So far you haven't been giving Mio and me a friendly attitude,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.75,0:03:47.75,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,but I tried thinking about it this way.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.08,0:03:52.25,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Perhaps that was out of concern for Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.13,0:03:59.14,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,The demon lord Wilbert feigned death\N from illness and disappeared,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.14,0:04:02.51,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,in order to stop the moderate faction\N that served him from going out of control.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.14,0:04:07.73,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,At the same time,\N he sent his daughter to the human realm,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.73,0:04:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in order to protect her\N from the reigning demon lord.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.81,0:04:15.03,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Then, while he watched over\Nhis daughter in the human realm,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.40,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,he sought to ascertain \Nhow the conflict between
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.40,0:04:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the moderate faction and the reigning\Ndemon-lord faction would fall,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.74,0:04:23.16,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,and thus he returned as another persona.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.91,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,That of the demon lord's brother.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.04,0:04:33.92,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,The gravity magic you used to rescue Mio\N was more than just power.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.34,0:04:37.97,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,There was a great kindness to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.22,0:04:44.26,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Though maybe that's all my misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.31,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Rukia-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.89,0:04:46.81,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Rukia,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.18,0:04:50.81,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,Are you finished?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:51.10,0:04:55.36,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,You told quite a fantastical tale,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.82,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,but are you done now?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.19,0:04:58.11,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:58.74,0:05:02.24,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,That's just a convenient interpretation for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.82,0:05:05.83,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,I have no intention\N to tell Mio or anyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.12,0:05:12.33,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,However, even if that's just\Na fairy tale I dreamt up,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.96,0:05:18.09,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,thank you very much for protecting us...\N for protecting Mio all this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.07,Dialogue Flashback,Rukia,0,0,0,,Basara-dono.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.90,0:05:41.20,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm protecting them.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.74,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Both Mio and the others.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.67,0:06:02.68,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.68,0:06:03.76,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.85,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.85,0:06:08.93,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Now let's make this even more tantalizing!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.27,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Click!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.91,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No, what is this?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.49,0:06:32.25,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,My body's getting hot all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.79,0:06:34.75,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.63,0:06:36.92,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.25,0:06:38.04,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.71,0:06:45.35,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,Seems that the special aphrodisiacs \NI whipped up are a little too strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.35,0:06:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tee-hee!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.05,0:06:47.55,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't give me a "tee-hee"!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.18,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm going crazy.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.18,0:06:55.56,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're so dirty, Onee.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.57,0:07:04.28,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,This is great as is!\N Or as they say in English, "no problem!"
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.57,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Now, let's keep it going!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.97,0:07:27.34,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,It's going to be sunny today!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.85,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,It's the perfect day for leisure!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.85,0:07:31.76,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy the day!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.94,0:07:36.81,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,I enjoyed today too much.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.35,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "today"?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.85,0:07:41.61,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're always going overboard!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.78,0:07:45.99,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Basara and I were this close to...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.99,0:07:46.36,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.99,0:07:49.57,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What're you saying under your breath, Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.57,0:07:50.62,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.95,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.83,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Well, please eat up.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.42,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Looks great again this morning!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.42,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It doesn't just look great. It {\i1}is{\i0} great.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.63,0:08:07.63,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,The eggs are sunny side up and not overdone,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.93,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,and the bacon is nice and crispy!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.93,0:08:14.31,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's a perfect breakfast that brings out\N the best of its ingredients.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.31,0:08:18.48,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,No, it's just a skill \Nthat all maids must have.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.94,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,This is indeed superb!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.44,0:08:26.61,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,To think my status as head of the Toujou \Nhousehold's kitchen would be in peril!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.95,0:08:33.87,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,This is seriously good.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.87,0:08:37.46,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We're really lucky to eat breakfasts \Nlike this every morning!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.96,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.96,0:08:48.51,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Zest, starting tomorrow allow me\N to cook breakfast, as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.22,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good at cooking, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.64,0:08:55.47,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Huh? But I couldn't put you\N through the trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.97,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.97,0:09:00.60,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm going to make Basara \Nsay mine's delicious, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.15,0:09:02.73,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,In that case, so will I.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.11,0:09:04.23,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.99,0:09:13.74,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't we take turns\N cooking from now on?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.49,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Right, Basara-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.49,0:09:18.33,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.95,0:09:20.50,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Are you okay with that, Zest?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.87,0:09:23.75,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Yes. If everyone else wants it that way.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:24.17,0:09:26.17,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.17,0:09:27.25,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.59,0:09:29.59,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.59,0:09:32.51,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Now, everyone,\N it's what you've been waiting for!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.76,0:09:35.01,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,It's always midsummer here!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.68,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,There are ocean waves,\N water slides, a lazy river,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.68,0:09:43.10,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,and a huge wave pool\N that can only be experienced here!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.10,0:09:45.02,Dialogue Italics,Screen & Announcer,0,0,0,,Seiou Aqua Resort!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.77,Dialogue Italics,Screen & Announcer,0,0,0,,Grand opening today!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.07,0:09:49.53,Dialogue Italics,Girls,0,0,0,,Come visit, everyone!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.03,0:09:53.49,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It's the middle of winter, so why?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.78,0:09:58.33,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,No, no, it's wonderful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.33,0:10:01.54,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,We now have a pool we can play in,\N even during the winter!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.54,0:10:03.79,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Let's be happier about this!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.29,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're the only one happy about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.80,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You just want to see people in swimsuits.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.80,0:10:08.80,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Grk!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.30,0:10:12.84,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san, you also want to see\N everyone in their swimsuits, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.18,0:10:13.80,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.80,0:10:16.01,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, no, I...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.06,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,If you had to choose\N between seeing them or not,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.68,0:10:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'd choose seeing them, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:23.31,0:10:23.73,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.14,0:10:25.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.23,0:10:28.44,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,It's good that you're honest!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.91,0:10:39.33,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.83,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.59,0:10:56.97,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,So this is one of the human realm's pools?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.97,0:10:58.47,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,It's impressive.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.10,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.77,0:11:06.27,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Okay, over here, over here.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.27,0:11:08.44,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Eyes over here, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.11,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Huh? Toujou-kun?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.19,0:11:15.74,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Tachibana?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.74,0:11:17.99,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You're here, too, Kajiura-senpai?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.99,0:11:18.95,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.20,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Everyone on the student council's with us.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.62,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,What about you all?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.91,0:11:26.42,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah, we thought something like this\N would be nice for once.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.42,0:11:27.25,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.08,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.05,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's nice now and then.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.05,0:11:32.30,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Listen, you.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.76,0:11:36.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Tachibana, you look good in that.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.30,0:11:38.64,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.64,0:11:42.64,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,If I knew you were coming,\N I'd have worn something cuter.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.02,0:11:45.48,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what's going on here,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.48,0:11:48.90,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,with all the usual suspects lined up together?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.90,0:11:50.06,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Takigawa-kun?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.23,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.23,0:11:52.98,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey, Basacchi!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.53,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.24,0:11:59.28,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Quite the trend follower, \Ncoming here on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.78,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.28,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.28,0:12:06.04,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You think I'm here alone by choice?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:07.54,0:12:12.46,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I'm here to keep an eye on you all\N on behalf of the demon realm.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.46,0:12:16.92,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Whenever you all go somewhere, \NI need to be nearby.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.63,0:12:24.31,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,With that out of the way, the main attractions here \Nare the stupidly huge lazy river over there,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.31,0:12:26.31,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,and the nation's longest water slide!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.98,0:12:29.81,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You can eat at the food court\N on the west side!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.81,0:12:33.32,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I recommend the yakisoba \Npacked with ingredients!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.19,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You're a total trend follower.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.19,0:12:39.45,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's all have fun today!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.45,0:12:41.57,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.96,0:12:54.96,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.96,0:12:55.96,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.30,0:13:00.34,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Quick shots!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.23,0:13:15.07,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what should we enjoy next?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.07,0:13:16.86,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.44,0:13:20.36,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,By the way, where did Yuki and the others go?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.82,0:13:23.41,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,We got separated from them.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.95,Dialogue Italics,Mio,0,0,0,,Then that means we're alone right now?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.59,0:13:42.22,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What a nice mood!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.22,0:13:47.72,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Now, stop worrying about the others \Nwatching, and be more aggressive!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.93,0:13:50.68,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.39,0:13:52.90,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Y-You're in the way!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.90,0:13:53.60,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.10,0:13:55.06,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.73,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.57,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,Photography's prohibited here.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.57,0:14:03.36,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,N-No, I was just adding\N to my Mio-sama collection.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.95,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,You can come to the security room with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.95,0:14:09.29,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,No! Hold on!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.29,0:14:13.04,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:13.04,0:14:14.88,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh? A church?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.50,0:14:18.59,Dialogue,Woman,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.59,0:14:22.55,Dialogue,Priest,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's give a round of applause\N to celebrate their happy union!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.60,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Wow. A wedding ceremony?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.89,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,So they host those here, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.89,0:14:29.89,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.35,0:14:32.18,Dialogue Top,Crowd,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.43,0:14:32.85,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.81,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,One day, I hope I...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.36,0:14:42.24,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.20,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You two are here, too?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.91,0:14:47.78,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,It's such a coincidence to run into the two of you here!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.78,0:14:49.58,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Hasegawa-sensei.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.41,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're here for fun, too, Sensei?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.41,0:14:53.37,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.37,0:14:55.04,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,For future reference.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.33,0:14:56.58,Dialogue Top,Kids,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.17,0:14:59.04,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I need to be aware of recent trends,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.92,0:15:03.05,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,in order to guide students as their teacher.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.72,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Toujou?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.01,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Your face is red. Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.01,0:15:09.39,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.10,Dialogue Top,Kids,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.06,Dialogue Top,Kids,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.14,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Whoa, look out!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.49,0:15:27.95,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You haven't forgotten your promise \Nabout this weekend, have you?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.08,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.87,0:15:32.33,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Then see you later, Toujou.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.41,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You, too, Naruse.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.88,0:15:44.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.84,0:15:52.06,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Getting my memory card confiscated is the worst!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.06,0:15:55.60,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What do they think\N someone's precious collection is?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.35,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Good thing I thought this might happen!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:59.52,0:16:00.48,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.48,0:16:02.61,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san? Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.90,0:16:07.15,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Is it the curse of the Master-Servant pact?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.16,0:16:10.20,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I need to relieve you quickly.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.20,0:16:13.49,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Is there anywhere we can hide?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.29,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Wait here for a moment.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.00,0:16:22.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Where can we avoid being seen?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.00,0:16:23.17,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.17,0:16:24.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.01,0:16:28.93,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,The curse is hitting her quite strongly.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.64,0:16:33.01,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,If you don't make Mio-sama submit\Nat once, she'll be in danger!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.23,0:16:39.23,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.69,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.48,Dialogue Top,Man,0,0,0,,This feels great!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:45.48,0:16:46.65,Dialogue Top,Woman,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.03,0:16:51.74,Dialogue Top,Woman,0,0,0,,That felt really great, didn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.74,0:16:52.82,Dialogue Top,Man,0,0,0,,Yeah, it did.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:55.95,0:16:58.00,Dialogue Top,Man,0,0,0,,This lazy river's great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.00,0:16:58.62,Dialogue Top,Woman,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio, we're doing it.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.00,0:17:01.83,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh? Here?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.83,0:17:02.67,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.67,0:17:06.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Everyone's focused on the pool, \Nso they won't notice us.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.00,0:17:07.05,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.05,0:17:10.05,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can to keep others\N from noticing us.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.05,0:17:12.18,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,So you do your best, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.47,0:17:16.43,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.10,0:17:19.35,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.35,0:17:20.69,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.27,0:17:22.81,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.69,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Huh? Naruse-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.86,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,You two are trying out this lazy river too?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.86,0:17:31.20,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,The lazy river feels great, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.53,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Right, Toujou-kun?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.53,0:17:34.62,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.62,0:17:36.58,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.12,0:17:39.71,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It'll be too late if we wait for them to go.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.71,0:17:40.75,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm starting.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.09,0:17:50.34,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Naruse-san? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.34,0:17:53.01,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.01,0:17:55.47,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.51,0:17:57.64,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,We're gonna fall!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.23,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.23,0:18:03.31,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down as much as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.31,0:18:06.23,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.85,0:18:45.23,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Naruse-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.15,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Toujou-kun?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.99,0:18:53.45,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,It's a wave!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.45,0:18:54.78,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,We're getting washed away!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.04,0:19:04.21,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,We're almost there, Mio!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:06.04,0:19:08.09,Dialogue Italics,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.80,0:19:21.22,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,That was so climactic!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.77,0:19:24.06,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,That was incredible, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.06,0:19:25.06,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.23,0:19:28.73,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, where are those two?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.26,Dialogue Flashback,Mio,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, I'm going to...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.31,0:20:04.35,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Ah, that was fun!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:04.35,0:20:06.52,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.52,0:20:09.52,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Though it was a bit embarrassing at the end.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.86,0:20:14.44,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,I can't believe I missed out\N on capturing such a sweet scene!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.44,0:20:16.70,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,I'm a failure of a succubus!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.78,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:19.07,0:20:20.20,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.78,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Next time, do it with me, as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.78,0:20:24.62,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,When you do, you can do something\N more incredible than you did with Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.79,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.33,0:20:29.54,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It was a miracle we didn't get caught this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.54,0:20:30.79,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.79,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,it was fun.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.79,0:20:33.67,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.26,0:20:36.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.09,0:20:38.93,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Let's go again, all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.51,0:20:40.30,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.56,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,And when we do, please wear\Nmy special selection of swimsuits!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.56,0:20:45.68,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No. I refuse.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.56,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.56,0:20:49.85,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.85,0:20:51.56,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I know they can't be good!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.57,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.07,0:20:57.57,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,I hope days like these can last forever.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.07,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Mio-sama?!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.08,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,That's—
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.33,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Stand back, Basara-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.87,0:21:08.08,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Wait, Zest.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.91,0:21:12.08,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's a sacred bird\N used by the hero village.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.08,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,The hero village?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.18,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.47,0:21:30.19,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That was rather violent \Nfor an ordinary letter.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.19,0:21:31.10,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,They're orders.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.48,0:21:34.31,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yuki?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.86,0:21:36.73,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to return.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.11,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Both Kurumi and me.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.99,0:21:40.61,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Why would they order that?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.61,0:21:43.62,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Well, a lot of things have happened lately.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.62,0:21:47.16,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Maybe the elders have decided \Nthey can't overlook it anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.12,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,There's more to our orders.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:49.50,0:21:53.96,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,We're to bring Basara and \NMio with us on our return.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.96,0:21:55.21,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Us too?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.21,0:21:57.38,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,The hero village wants Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.63,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.63,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,I figured this would come.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:06.26,0:22:07.64,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.97,0:22:10.64,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,Seems that those elders of the hero village
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.64,0:22:13.40,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,have begun to make their move.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.40,0:22:14.65,Dialogue,Rukia,0,0,0,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.23,0:22:18.90,Dialogue,Rukia,0,0,0,,If necessary, I'll head there again.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.23,0:22:20.19,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.19,0:22:23.78,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,In fact, if we act carelessly, \Nwe might make things worse.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.07,0:22:27.03,Dialogue,Rukia,0,0,0,,However, we can't just leave this be.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:27.70,0:22:31.04,Dialogue,Rukia,0,0,0,,We don't know what kind of danger\N Maria might face.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:32.16,0:22:33.54,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.33,0:22:37.25,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,Let's leave this in his hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.47,0:22:50.02,Dialogue,Three,0,0,0,,Take the necessary measures \Nif it comes down to it, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.60,0:22:55.06,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,What shall we do now, huh, Basacchi?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.40,0:22:58.15,Dialogue,Kurmi,0,0,0,,We can't do this!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:58.15,0:23:00.57,Dialogue,Kurmi,0,0,0,,If they’re asking us to bring Basara-niichan and Mio,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:00.57,0:23:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the elders are definitely plotting something!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:04.20,0:23:06.57,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Can't we just ignore the letter?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:07.91,0:23:11.08,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You're right. That would be one option.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:11.37,0:23:18.08,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,But considering our future,\N this isn't such a simple matter.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:19.67,0:23:22.55,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,The elders sense a threat.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:22.55,0:23:25.18,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,An equilibrium has been maintained\N ever since the war,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:25.18,0:23:27.59,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,but they're afraid that the balance \Nbetween heroes and demons
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.59,0:23:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will be toppled because of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:36.85,0:23:38.36,Dialogue Flashback,Maria,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean we can do this!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.36,0:23:41.40,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,We can't just bring Mio-sama to the hero village!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:41.40,0:23:42.86,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.15,0:23:46.11,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how dangerous \Nthat'd be for Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.11,0:23:50.12,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,The commotion in the demon realm \Nwas finally settled, and now—
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.49,0:23:53.62,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Just leave us alone already!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:56.00,0:23:57.04,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.25,0:24:00.38,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:00.38,0:24:04.88,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I'll protect you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:11.35,0:24:12.14,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:24.73,0:24:26.65,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.53,0:24:29.66,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,No, you're right on time.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:30.07,0:24:31.45,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You came for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:32.03,0:24:33.41,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:34.91,0:24:38.37,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm sure you're also busy\N with a bunch of things.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:38.37,0:24:41.38,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No! We made the promise \Na while back, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:41.92,0:24:45.42,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I let Mio and the others know\N ahead of time that I was heading out.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.01,0:24:48.43,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I see. In that case...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.93,0:24:55.27,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You're all mine until tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:06.07,0:25:06.94,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.61,0:25:11.32,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,W-Wow, this daikon's so thick and hard!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.32,0:25:13.45,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I bet it would taste good served as oden!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:14.20,0:25:18.46,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I should increase my cooking repertoire\N before Basara comes home.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.46,0:25:20.21,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to surprise him after all!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:20.96,0:25:22.21,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:23.96,0:25:25.71,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Oh, these look good, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.42,0:26:15.30,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think just the two of us should return?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:15.85,0:26:18.56,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,We just need to persuade the elders anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:19.85,0:26:22.56,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,If Basara decided that, then yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:23.39,0:26:25.44,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,But that's not the case.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:26.11,0:26:30.86,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara would never let us go alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:31.40,0:26:35.82,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,But if Basara-niichan returns \Nto the village, that means...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:43.92,0:26:46.38,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's too cruel.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:47.42,0:26:51.63,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Even so, we can't afford\N to not return in our current situation.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:00.10,0:27:02.60,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Hey, are you serious about that?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:05.02,0:27:07.61,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You sound like you've\Ngone back to the old you.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:08.23,0:27:12.44,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're hiding how you truly feel \Nwhile you suffer.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:12.44,0:27:16.82,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you wouldn't \Nunderstand our suffering.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:20.62,0:27:21.66,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Onee...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:24.50,0:27:25.87,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:29.67,0:27:32.55,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Good grief, how dedicated.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:35.47,0:27:36.13,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:37.47,0:27:38.60,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:38.60,0:27:39.93,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Thinking again?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:40.68,0:27:43.60,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Your head was in the clouds\N during our time on the train as well,
Dialogue: 99,0:27:44.27,0:27:48.19,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,but you promised to think only about me\N until tomorrow morning, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:48.19,0:27:49.77,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:50.57,0:27:52.15,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Is there something troubling you?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:52.15,0:27:53.61,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:53.61,0:27:56.70,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,There are several things that I\Nsuddenly need to make a decision on.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:57.28,0:27:59.57,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,And those things are important issues
Dialogue: 99,0:27:59.57,0:28:04.08,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,not just to you, but others\Nas well, aren't they?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:04.08,0:28:05.71,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.12,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Very much so.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:10.46,0:28:12.96,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll let you in\N on a good way to think about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:14.92,0:28:15.72,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:15.72,0:28:19.05,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,If you're in a dilemma because\Nthe problems aren't just your own,
Dialogue: 99,0:28:20.01,0:28:23.72,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,then think of their problems\N as if they were your own, as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:24.39,0:28:27.89,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Do that and you'll be able to decide\N what it is you want to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:27.89,0:28:28.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,But that would—
Dialogue: 99,0:28:28.81,0:28:34.73,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Of course, your decisions aren't necessarily \Ngoing to be good for every single person.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:35.49,0:28:36.99,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,That includes yourself, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:37.57,0:28:39.91,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,However, that's exactly why you need
Dialogue: 99,0:28:39.91,0:28:42.78,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,to steel yourself and have\Nan unwavering resolve.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:43.33,0:28:45.24,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Unwavering resolve?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:45.24,0:28:46.37,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:47.00,0:28:48.50,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,That way, the decisions you make
Dialogue: 99,0:28:48.50,0:28:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will be ones both you and others \Ncan be proud of and won't regret.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:55.42,0:28:57.42,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Was that a little helpful?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:57.42,0:28:58.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:58.30,0:28:59.26,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:59.72,0:29:04.81,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,In that case, could you start focusing on me?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:04.81,0:29:06.77,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,From now until tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:13.69,0:29:14.65,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:34.46,0:29:36.59,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,No way, that...
Dialogue: 99,0:29:36.59,0:29:37.55,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:53.23,0:29:54.98,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.87,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,No, if you keep going...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:12.62,0:30:14.21,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:15.67,0:30:17.34,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I-It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:40.44,0:30:41.53,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:42.32,0:30:43.53,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:47.41,0:30:48.49,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:48.49,0:30:50.70,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:04.38,0:31:06.39,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yuki, do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:07.30,0:31:08.14,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:09.89,0:31:10.64,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Where's Yuki?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:11.14,0:31:13.39,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Onee said she was taking a shower.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:13.39,0:31:14.31,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:15.81,0:31:17.10,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:17.10,0:31:18.65,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:20.73,0:31:24.61,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Wow, everyone's so cute!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:24.61,0:31:26.28,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Wow, yes they are.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:26.28,0:31:27.49,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's a nice photo.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:27.49,0:31:28.91,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Everyone has a good smile.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:29.70,0:31:33.12,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's because the photo was taken\N before that incident happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:33.12,0:31:33.91,Dialogue,Three,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:34.21,0:31:37.92,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I think we were always smiling\N back in those days.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:38.33,0:31:41.42,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan, Onee, and me... all of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:41.96,0:31:43.21,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:43.21,0:31:45.59,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's a side of you all I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:45.59,0:31:46.55,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:49.76,0:31:50.81,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:50.81,0:31:52.18,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:00.06,0:32:00.94,Dialogue Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:08.70,0:32:11.28,Dialogue Flashback,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:15.29,0:32:16.21,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:17.96,0:32:21.21,Dialogue Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Yuki?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:21.21,0:32:22.46,Dialogue Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,Elder.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:22.46,0:32:26.97,Dialogue Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,Those two have been exiled \Nfrom the hero village.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:26.97,0:32:29.89,Dialogue Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,But you're going to live as a hero.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:29.89,0:32:32.97,Dialogue Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,You will not be allowed\N to interact with them anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:37.94,0:32:39.06,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:40.65,0:32:43.02,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I couldn't chase after him.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:43.02,0:32:44.61,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I couldn't protect him.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:44.61,0:32:47.36,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Not during his most painful moments.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:49.95,0:32:53.37,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm sure Basara will comply \Nwith the Elders' orders,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:53.37,0:32:55.49,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,to protect us all,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:55.49,0:32:58.33,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,without regard for his own suffering.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:58.33,0:33:01.13,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I can't just tell Basara not \Nto go when he's like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:01.54,0:33:06.09,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I don't have any right to say that\N when I couldn't say anything back then.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:06.09,0:33:08.22,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Why're you worrying about this\N all on your own?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:11.84,0:33:12.51,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:13.14,0:33:17.39,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You've been thinking of Basara\N both then and now,
Dialogue: 99,0:33:17.39,0:33:20.02,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,but you're putting a lid on those feelings?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:20.77,0:33:23.02,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're really dumb.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:24.90,0:33:27.61,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's fine. You can be more honest.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:27.61,0:33:28.40,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:29.24,0:33:32.91,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I know you all have a regret\N from your past you can't erase.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:32.91,0:33:38.37,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I can't just casually claim to understand \Nhow much you've suffered because of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:38.37,0:33:40.37,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,But still, I want you to tell me.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:40.37,0:33:42.88,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to hear how you truly feel.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:42.88,0:33:43.92,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:44.29,0:33:48.13,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You saved me many times during\Nour time in the demon realm, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:48.13,0:33:49.92,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You and Kurumi-chan both did.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:50.80,0:33:52.93,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,So it's my turn now.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:00.27,0:34:02.98,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,This is your homeland, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:04.73,0:34:08.40,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to go to the hero village.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:08.73,0:34:09.61,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:09.61,0:34:11.03,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Yuki.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:11.03,0:34:12.91,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Don't bear this all on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:12.91,0:34:14.62,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:15.16,0:34:18.04,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,If anything happens to you, then I'd—
Dialogue: 99,0:34:20.45,0:34:24.75,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to help Basara, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:27.55,0:34:29.13,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:29.13,0:34:34.84,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to know what suffering you, \NKurumi-chan, and Basara have been carrying.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.59,0:34:40.22,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I believe I have to help the three of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:40.22,0:34:41.31,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:41.31,0:34:46.19,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,After all, Basara's your most\Nprecious childhood friend.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:46.19,0:34:51.19,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,And Basara's the most precious\NOnii-chan in the world to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:56.91,0:35:02.54,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,The truth is, I don't want \Nto see Basara suffer anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:02.54,0:35:04.58,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:05.21,0:35:09.63,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,If that destiny is unavoidable, \Nthen let's stand against it together.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:10.13,0:35:13.76,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,That way we can all save Basara\N together this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:13.76,0:35:14.51,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:38.41,0:35:41.66,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Sorry for slipping into your mind\N without permission.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:42.20,0:35:43.50,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Maria's doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:43.91,0:35:45.00,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:45.00,0:35:48.00,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I did it because I wanted to have \Na proper talk with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:48.00,0:35:49.75,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,One without hiding anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:51.63,0:35:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so pushy.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:54.55,0:35:59.14,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Jeez. With the two of them that amped up,\N we have no choice but to go.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:09.15,0:36:10.61,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:10.61,0:36:13.19,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You should do as you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:13.78,0:36:16.32,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,But please don't forget this:
Dialogue: 99,0:36:16.32,0:36:18.66,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,you have me on your side.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:19.16,0:36:21.91,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I'll grant you some of my power.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:21.91,0:36:25.16,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,For you, and for the future of you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:32.13,0:36:35.51,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Basara, no matter what happens...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:36.09,0:36:37.84,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:59.99,0:37:01.62,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:02.37,0:37:04.12,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Good morning, Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:04.91,0:37:06.62,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:27.22,0:37:29.77,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,"An unwavering resolve," huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:31.06,0:37:34.57,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,It's true that we can't avoid \Nreturning to the hero village
Dialogue: 99,0:37:34.57,0:37:37.32,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,if we want to protect our future.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:37.32,0:37:38.53,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:52.50,0:37:54.25,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Am I afraid?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:54.25,0:37:56.00,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Of returning there?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:56.59,0:37:59.22,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Of facing my past?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:01.22,0:38:02.05,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:02.05,0:38:04.47,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You finally returned.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:05.64,0:38:07.22,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:08.02,0:38:08.72,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:14.36,0:38:16.23,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Looks good!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.98,0:38:19.61,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you treat me.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:19.61,0:38:22.78,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Surprised you can say that\N after planning on it from the start.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:22.78,0:38:23.74,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:23.74,0:38:26.49,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Oh, everything between these two pieces is mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:26.95,0:38:30.25,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,So, what're you going to do about the hero village?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:31.54,0:38:33.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:33.29,0:38:34.25,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:34.25,0:38:37.04,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Do you think we don't know\N anything about that?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:40.59,0:38:44.05,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,This is a matter between\Nmembers of the hero clan.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.05,0:38:46.26,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with you demons.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:46.26,0:38:49.56,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We'll protect our daily life\N with our own hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:50.27,0:38:53.69,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Oh, this one's grilled up good.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:54.77,0:38:56.77,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I appreciate the nice spirit,
Dialogue: 99,0:38:57.19,0:38:59.73,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,but things are finally getting settled \Nbetween the moderate faction
Dialogue: 99,0:38:59.73,0:39:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the reigning demon-lord faction.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:04.24,0:39:08.70,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,If you get all emotional and act on your own
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.70,0:39:11.62,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,at a time like this, there'll be a lot of trouble for us.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:15.83,0:39:19.42,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Basacchi, I think you have\Nthe wrong impression here.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:19.42,0:39:24.55,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I'm here to keep an eye on you,\N not be your best friend.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:25.51,0:39:26.55,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:26.55,0:39:28.85,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Then you understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:28.85,0:39:31.89,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,We're just leaving Naruse Mio in your care.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:31.89,0:39:36.06,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,If she's put in danger,\N then we'll eliminate that threat.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:36.06,0:39:39.57,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,We'll destroy your hometown if necessary,
Dialogue: 99,0:39:42.57,0:39:47.78,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,and it's none of our concern if you\Nall lose this meager happiness of yours.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:50.16,0:39:52.29,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,We'll erase them completely.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:52.29,0:39:54.25,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,That's my job, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:56.00,0:39:59.34,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Overcooked meat just isn't worth eating.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:59.34,0:40:00.75,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Are you serious about that?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:00.75,0:40:02.00,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:02.00,0:40:03.88,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You seriously got to be careful.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:04.84,0:40:06.09,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:07.51,0:40:09.14,Dialogue,Two,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:11.76,0:40:13.72,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,We made a lot.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:14.39,0:40:16.81,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,We might have gone a bit overboard.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:16.81,0:40:17.94,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:17.94,0:40:19.65,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara's coming home.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:20.40,0:40:23.78,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Still, Basara-sama's late.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:31.62,0:40:32.53,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:33.20,0:40:38.25,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,We're like wives waiting for our husband.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:39.83,0:40:41.67,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if we were.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:42.42,0:40:45.05,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're getting ahead of yourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:45.05,0:40:46.59,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,We haven't even married him yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:46.92,0:40:50.93,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Good idea! Let's do that!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:51.22,0:40:52.43,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:02.86,0:41:05.23,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Has to be here, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:05.23,0:41:06.32,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:06.61,0:41:09.03,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,This is the second time we've fought, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:09.03,0:41:10.95,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No, the third.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:10.95,0:41:12.37,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.70,0:41:20.29,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Now no one will interfere.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:20.29,0:41:21.50,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:21.50,0:41:22.46,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:07.63,0:42:08.84,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:08.84,0:42:13.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I won't let even you lay a hand\N on our peaceful lives or our future!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:13.68,0:42:16.51,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,So that's your will? Your pride?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:16.51,0:42:19.52,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,However, can you really protect that
Dialogue: 99,0:42:19.52,0:42:22.56,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,when you're a coward \Ntrembling at your own past?!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:27.90,0:42:29.07,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:48.92,0:42:49.92,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:49.92,0:42:52.80,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,The hero village?!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:56.68,0:42:58.47,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,See? Look at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:03.69,0:43:05.85,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You won't let anyone lay a hand on it?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:05.85,0:43:08.36,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Don't go spouting crap you can't back up!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:08.36,0:43:11.03,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,The only reason you've survived\N this long is that
Dialogue: 99,0:43:11.03,0:43:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your clever tricks\N miraculously happened to work out!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:15.78,0:43:17.03,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:25.12,0:43:28.79,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You should learn your place already!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:33.88,0:43:35.47,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,That's it, then?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:46.35,0:43:49.73,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Nice facing yourself for once, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:51.11,0:43:52.61,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.36,0:43:55.57,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:01.16,0:44:03.37,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I can't use Banishing Shift?!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:16.01,0:44:17.18,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:17.18,0:44:19.51,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Have your skills gone dull\N from all that peace?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:19.85,0:44:24.02,Dialogue Italics,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Or is something happening within Basacchi?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:32.40,0:44:36.03,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Well, doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:01.43,0:45:02.22,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:02.22,0:45:04.01,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Done already?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:04.01,0:45:05.72,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:05.72,0:45:08.81,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Guess I'll deliver the finishing blow now.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:12.56,0:45:17.57,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We'll take Naruse \Nand the others into our care.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:19.36,0:45:20.57,Dialogue Flashback,Mio,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:30.75,0:45:31.83,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:31.83,0:45:38.84,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You're right. It might be a miracle\N that we've made it through everything so far.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:38.84,0:45:41.68,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We borrowed power from\Na lot of different people, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:41.68,0:45:44.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:45.68,0:45:49.14,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We never gave up,\N no matter what happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:49.14,0:45:51.40,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We had faith in ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:51.40,0:45:53.11,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,And we fought!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:53.48,0:45:57.11,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,That's why we're here right now!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:00.74,0:46:02.11,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:20.13,0:46:21.01,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:25.01,0:46:29.52,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm going to personally protect their smiles,\N no matter what!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:50.50,0:46:54.46,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I have never once given up on our future!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:54.46,0:46:58.09,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa!
Dialogue: 99,0:47:15.81,0:47:17.31,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:17.31,0:47:23.36,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Looks like you haven't slacked off just because\N the demon problems are settling down.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:25.07,0:47:26.49,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:26.49,0:47:28.24,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:28.24,0:47:31.75,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I'll keep watching to see how\Nfar that will of yours can go.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:32.54,0:47:33.75,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,That guy...
Dialogue: 99,0:47:41.63,0:47:42.51,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:46.05,0:47:47.01,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:48.22,0:47:49.60,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:51.31,0:47:53.02,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you...
Dialogue: 99,0:47:53.43,0:47:55.52,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Well? Surprised?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:57.90,0:48:00.40,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:01.32,0:48:02.40,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:02.40,0:48:05.40,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No, you all look pretty.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:05.40,0:48:06.66,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Really pretty.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:10.66,0:48:15.12,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I was fine, but everyone insisted.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:15.12,0:48:19.50,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Oh ho? You were pretty\Ninto this, too, Kurumi-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:19.50,0:48:23.17,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,You were saying,\N "I'll finally get to be Basara-niichan's bride!"
Dialogue: 99,0:48:23.42,0:48:25.42,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh? Then you mean these are...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:25.42,0:48:26.22,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:26.22,0:48:30.72,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Maria suggested we should\Nall become your brides,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:30.72,0:48:33.89,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,as a way to strengthen\Nour bonds as your family.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:33.89,0:48:35.93,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's a great idea?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:35.93,0:48:41.69,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,The Master-Servant pact makes everyone\Nstronger when their bonds are stronger!
Dialogue: 99,0:48:42.07,0:48:46.19,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Doing this will make all of us even stronger!
Dialogue: 99,0:48:46.65,0:48:49.70,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,With this, we should be fine\N even if we do return to the village.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:51.45,0:48:52.95,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You all...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:53.58,0:48:54.74,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:54.74,0:48:58.58,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,I knew it. You were planning on going \Nto the hero village all by yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:58.58,0:48:59.21,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:59.50,0:49:02.38,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,The other day you said,
Dialogue: 99,0:49:02.88,0:49:07.05,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,430)}No matter what happens, I'll protect you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:07.42,0:49:10.01,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Not "we," but "I."
Dialogue: 99,0:49:10.01,0:49:13.93,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,So I thought that might be so.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:15.89,0:49:17.43,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:17.77,0:49:21.44,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You always, always go into\Nthe most danger all by yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:21.44,0:49:24.98,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Are we that bad?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:27.36,0:49:29.74,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Do you have that little faith in us?!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:34.53,0:49:35.66,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:35.66,0:49:37.83,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio, your curse...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:37.83,0:49:40.12,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Of course it would.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:40.12,0:49:43.34,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No matter how much I may be thinking of you,
Dialogue: 99,0:49:43.34,0:49:47.71,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,my desire to go with you is still selfish.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:48.09,0:49:51.09,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,But I need to say it.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:51.09,0:49:55.22,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you'll go on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:55.76,0:50:02.06,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,The hero village probably believes\N I'm the root of their current problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:02.06,0:50:04.06,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,So I should just go by myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:04.86,0:50:06.11,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,If I do...
Dialogue: 99,0:50:06.11,0:50:11.07,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Then maybe Kurumi, \N Mio, and I can avoid harm.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:11.07,0:50:14.16,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're right that that is a possibility.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:14.16,0:50:17.91,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,But that's your own selfish belief.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:17.91,0:50:20.91,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll never let you do that.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:24.46,0:50:25.13,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yuki?!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:25.54,0:50:27.96,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Why're you being this rash?!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:27.96,0:50:30.30,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:30.30,0:50:33.51,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Because this is about you!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:33.51,0:50:36.30,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Onee and Mio are both serious about this.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:36.30,0:50:39.27,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,No, it's not just those two.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:39.72,0:50:44.52,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan, this is how\N all five of us feel!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:46.65,0:50:48.78,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria. Kurumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:49.36,0:50:55.28,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Basara-sama, just as you\Ntreasure us above all else,
Dialogue: 99,0:50:55.28,0:50:58.87,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,we treasure you, as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:58.87,0:51:02.41,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Even if you tell us "no," we won't give up.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:02.41,0:51:06.17,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,We'll follow you, even if it\Nmeans disobeying your orders!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:06.17,0:51:13.43,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,So please forgive our selfish desire\N to accompany you.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:17.68,0:51:18.76,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Zest?!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:18.76,0:51:20.68,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Basara,
Dialogue: 99,0:51:21.10,0:51:24.10,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,make us submit.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:24.10,0:51:27.15,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Make us stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:27.77,0:51:30.19,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Until you can rest assured.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:31.11,0:51:32.57,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 99,0:51:32.94,0:51:37.07,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Kurumi-san and I will help you, of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:37.07,0:51:38.58,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Right, Kurumi-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:47.38,0:51:50.71,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Onii-chan, do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:58.22,0:51:59.47,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:00.85,0:52:01.77,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:03.89,0:52:04.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:07.27,0:52:08.23,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Kurumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:10.11,0:52:11.36,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:13.53,0:52:14.44,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Zest.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:14.44,0:52:15.61,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Basara-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:17.70,0:52:20.74,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'll relieve you now.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:35.51,0:52:38.34,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara, me, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:38.34,0:52:40.01,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:46.06,0:52:49.15,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara, me, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:54.78,0:52:57.65,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan, me, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:57.65,0:53:01.28,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,I'll be your partner before Basara-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:01.28,0:53:02.41,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Maria?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:05.04,0:53:07.29,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Oh, Maria!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:21.43,0:53:25.01,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan, does it feel good?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:25.01,0:53:27.56,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Am I doing it properly?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:27.81,0:53:29.31,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,You're doing well,
Dialogue: 99,0:53:30.31,0:53:31.44,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Kurumi-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:36.19,0:53:38.32,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,You shouldn't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:42.12,0:53:47.33,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,This is our wedding, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:47.91,0:53:50.58,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:50.58,0:53:54.63,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,In that case, I have this for us!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:04.30,0:54:06.68,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria, what's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:07.02,0:54:10.94,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Instead of a rice shower, \Nit's an aphrodisiac shower!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:10.94,0:54:14.44,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,It's to celebrate overcoming \Nthe Succubus's baptism!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:14.69,0:54:17.73,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,J-Jeez, Maria!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:21.91,0:54:24.62,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:24.62,0:54:26.33,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm yearning for it!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:26.66,0:54:28.12,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:29.08,0:54:32.12,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Come to me, Basara-niichan!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:32.83,0:54:34.21,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Basara-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:36.54,0:54:38.00,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:40.26,0:54:42.38,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah. Here I go.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:43.74,0:55:47.24,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm never letting you go.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:49.95,0:55:51.24,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:52.58,0:55:55.83,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We are family, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:00.13,0:56:00.96,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:34.04,0:56:35.20,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:35.20,0:56:36.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:36.66,0:56:38.42,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep us waiting?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:38.42,0:56:39.92,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's an important day.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:39.92,0:56:42.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:44.92,0:56:45.51,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:45.92,0:56:48.72,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,We're perfectly packed now!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:48.72,0:56:51.22,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Are you sure\N that isn't a bit too big for you?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:54.68,0:56:56.27,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:56.89,0:56:58.64,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,There, perfect!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:58.64,0:56:59.52,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:59.85,0:57:01.65,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:02.23,0:57:03.78,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Did you make all these?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:04.28,0:57:07.20,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,If you had said something,\NI would have made them.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:07.20,0:57:08.11,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:08.11,0:57:11.03,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I was in charge of breakfast \Nthis morning, anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:11.03,0:57:13.41,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Well? Perfect, aren't they?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:13.41,0:57:16.20,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,They look really normal, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:16.20,0:57:19.04,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I would have made character bento.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:20.00,0:57:21.04,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:27.63,0:57:29.63,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's good!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:29.63,0:57:30.55,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:30.80,0:57:32.35,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll try some, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:32.35,0:57:33.68,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:33.68,0:57:36.64,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I was hungry!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:36.64,0:57:37.93,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:37.93,0:57:40.81,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,There's no point to the bento\N if you eat them here!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:40.81,0:57:43.56,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama, so stingy!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:44.57,0:57:46.57,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's my share, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:46.57,0:57:49.15,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Mio, what's wrong with a little bit?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:49.15,0:57:51.49,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I told you "no"!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:56.66,0:57:57.83,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It's about time to head out.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:58.87,0:57:59.79,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:19.10,0:58:21.35,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't look back at the past.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:21.35,0:58:22.44,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Look toward tomorrow,
Dialogue: 99,0:58:22.44,0:58:23.73,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,toward hope,
Dialogue: 99,0:58:23.73,0:58:24.81,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,toward the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:25.61,0:58:27.86,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,We're going to seize it.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:11.32,0:59:13.82,Dialogue,Hero,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get here, Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:14.32,0:59:19.20,Dialogue,Hero,0,0,0,,The immutable past\N is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.20,0:59:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.20,0:59:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.20,0:59:28.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.66,0:00:15.25,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Good grief. He sure went\N and did something unnecessary.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.45,0:00:20.00,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,He's a fool who can't see the big picture.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.75,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Damn Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.75,0:00:28.80,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Getting involved in the power struggle between\Ndemon realm factions is already unforgivable,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.34,0:00:34.51,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,but he actually united them.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.10,0:00:40.40,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,There's Jin, too. Both parent and child \Nare taking too much into their own hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.40,0:00:45.57,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Regardless, this is a grave matter\N that threatens the hero village's survival.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.57,0:00:49.57,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,We need careful consideration\N on how to proceed.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.57,0:00:51.07,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.07,0:00:54.45,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,Any who would harm our duty, \Nno matter who they may be...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.70,0:01:00.12,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,We certainly can't afford \Nto overlook this any longer.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.29,0:01:06.80,Dialogue,Elder,0,0,0,,If he is going to bring \Nabout calamity again, then...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.72,0:01:16.64,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,How's this, Basara-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.14,0:01:17.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.81,0:01:20.44,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Oh, well, it does feel good.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.31,0:01:24.73,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Am I bothering you, Basara-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.23,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.61,0:01:28.99,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.98,0:01:43.33,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Enough moaning, Zest!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.33,0:01:44.63,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.13,0:01:49.21,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.42,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Yuki-san and Kurumi-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.01,0:01:54.93,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What're you three wearing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.93,0:02:00.39,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,W-Well, Maria said you'd enjoy this more.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.90,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What nonsense is that horny\Nloli-succubus spouting now?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.23,0:02:06.98,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,There you have it, Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.98,0:02:09.94,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,So we'll be washing you, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.03,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.26,0:02:37.30,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,"Naughty Bath Time with Sexy Beauties..."
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.30,0:02:41.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another gem has been added\Nto my treasured collection!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.93,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Listen, you!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.35,0:02:45.94,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,How is it, Basara?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.94,0:02:47.98,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,D-Does it feel good?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.69,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.57,0:02:51.48,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It does?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.69,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.07,0:02:53.99,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.66,0:03:01.45,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,Henceforth we will fundamentally \Nhave no interaction with you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.50,0:03:05.12,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,With a military alliance\Ncurrently being formed
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.12,0:03:08.21,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,between us and the reigning\Ndemon-lord faction,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.21,0:03:10.92,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,we must avoid provoking useless \Nsuspicion and speculation
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.92,0:03:15.22,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,that would come from making \Ncontact with you without cause.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.76,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.76,0:03:21.22,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,You can't let go of the peace \Nyou've finally obtained.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.68,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,That's all there is to discuss.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.68,0:03:26.31,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,You should return to your world.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.36,0:03:33.11,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Are you planning to bid farewell \Nto Mio without saying anything?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.15,0:03:35.24,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Wilbert-san!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.07,0:03:39.49,Dialogue Flashback,Rukia,0,0,0,,Basara-dono.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.78,0:03:44.75,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,So far you haven't been giving Mio and me a friendly attitude,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.75,0:03:47.75,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,but I tried thinking about it this way.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.08,0:03:52.25,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Perhaps that was out of concern for Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.13,0:03:59.14,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,The demon lord Wilbert feigned death\N from illness and disappeared,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.14,0:04:02.51,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,in order to stop the moderate faction\N that served him from going out of control.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.14,0:04:07.73,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,At the same time,\N he sent his daughter to the human realm,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.73,0:04:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in order to protect her\N from the reigning demon lord.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.81,0:04:15.03,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Then, while he watched over\Nhis daughter in the human realm,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.40,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,he sought to ascertain \Nhow the conflict between
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.40,0:04:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the moderate faction and the reigning\Ndemon-lord faction would fall,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.74,0:04:23.16,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,and thus he returned as another persona.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.91,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,That of the demon lord's brother.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.04,0:04:33.92,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,The gravity magic you used to rescue Mio\N was more than just power.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.34,0:04:37.97,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,There was a great kindness to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.22,0:04:44.26,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Though maybe that's all my misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.31,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Rukia-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.89,0:04:46.81,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Rukia,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.18,0:04:50.81,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,Are you finished?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:51.10,0:04:55.36,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,You told quite a fantastical tale,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.82,Dialogue Flashback,Wilberto,0,0,0,,but are you done now?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.19,0:04:58.11,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:58.74,0:05:02.24,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,That's just a convenient interpretation for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.82,0:05:05.83,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,I have no intention\N to tell Mio or anyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.12,0:05:12.33,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,However, even if that's just\Na fairy tale I dreamt up,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.96,0:05:18.09,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,thank you very much for protecting us...\N for protecting Mio all this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.07,Dialogue Flashback,Rukia,0,0,0,,Basara-dono.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.90,0:05:41.20,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm protecting them.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.74,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Both Mio and the others.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.67,0:06:02.68,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.68,0:06:03.76,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.85,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.85,0:06:08.93,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Now let's make this even more tantalizing!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.27,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Click!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.91,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No, what is this?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.49,0:06:32.25,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,My body's getting hot all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.79,0:06:34.75,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.63,0:06:36.92,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.25,0:06:38.04,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.71,0:06:45.35,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,Seems that the special aphrodisiacs \NI whipped up are a little too strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.35,0:06:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tee-hee!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.05,0:06:47.55,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't give me a "tee-hee"!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.18,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm going crazy.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.18,0:06:55.56,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're so dirty, Onee.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.57,0:07:04.28,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,This is great as is!\N Or as they say in English, "no problem!"
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.57,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Now, let's keep it going!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.97,0:07:27.34,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,It's going to be sunny today!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.85,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,It's the perfect day for leisure!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.85,0:07:31.76,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy the day!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.94,0:07:36.81,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,I enjoyed today too much.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.35,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "today"?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.85,0:07:41.61,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're always going overboard!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.78,0:07:45.99,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Basara and I were this close to...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.99,0:07:46.36,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.99,0:07:49.57,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What're you saying under your breath, Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.57,0:07:50.62,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.95,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.83,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Well, please eat up.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.42,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Looks great again this morning!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.42,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It doesn't just look great. It {\i1}is{\i0} great.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.63,0:08:07.63,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,The eggs are sunny side up and not overdone,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.93,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,and the bacon is nice and crispy!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.93,0:08:14.31,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's a perfect breakfast that brings out\N the best of its ingredients.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.31,0:08:18.48,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,No, it's just a skill \Nthat all maids must have.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.94,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,This is indeed superb!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.44,0:08:26.61,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,To think my status as head of the Toujou \Nhousehold's kitchen would be in peril!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.95,0:08:33.87,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,This is seriously good.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.87,0:08:37.46,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We're really lucky to eat breakfasts \Nlike this every morning!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.96,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.96,0:08:48.51,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Zest, starting tomorrow allow me\N to cook breakfast, as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.22,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good at cooking, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.64,0:08:55.47,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Huh? But I couldn't put you\N through the trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.97,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.97,0:09:00.60,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm going to make Basara \Nsay mine's delicious, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.15,0:09:02.73,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,In that case, so will I.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.11,0:09:04.23,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.99,0:09:13.74,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't we take turns\N cooking from now on?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.49,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Right, Basara-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.49,0:09:18.33,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.95,0:09:20.50,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Are you okay with that, Zest?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.87,0:09:23.75,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Yes. If everyone else wants it that way.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:24.17,0:09:26.17,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.17,0:09:27.25,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.59,0:09:29.59,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.59,0:09:32.51,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Now, everyone,\N it's what you've been waiting for!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.76,0:09:35.01,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,It's always midsummer here!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.68,Dialogue Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,There are ocean waves,\N water slides, a lazy river,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.68,0:09:43.10,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,and a huge wave pool\N that can only be experienced here!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.10,0:09:45.02,Dialogue Italics,Screen & Announcer,0,0,0,,Seiou Aqua Resort!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.77,Dialogue Italics,Screen & Announcer,0,0,0,,Grand opening today!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.07,0:09:49.53,Dialogue Italics,Girls,0,0,0,,Come visit, everyone!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.03,0:09:53.49,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It's the middle of winter, so why?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.78,0:09:58.33,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,No, no, it's wonderful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.33,0:10:01.54,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,We now have a pool we can play in,\N even during the winter!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.54,0:10:03.79,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Let's be happier about this!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.29,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're the only one happy about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.80,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You just want to see people in swimsuits.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.80,0:10:08.80,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Grk!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.30,0:10:12.84,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san, you also want to see\N everyone in their swimsuits, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.18,0:10:13.80,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.80,0:10:16.01,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, no, I...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.06,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,If you had to choose\N between seeing them or not,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.68,0:10:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'd choose seeing them, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:23.31,0:10:23.73,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.14,0:10:25.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.23,0:10:28.44,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,It's good that you're honest!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.91,0:10:39.33,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.83,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.59,0:10:56.97,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,So this is one of the human realm's pools?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.97,0:10:58.47,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,It's impressive.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.10,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.77,0:11:06.27,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Okay, over here, over here.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.27,0:11:08.44,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Eyes over here, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.11,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Huh? Toujou-kun?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.19,0:11:15.74,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Tachibana?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.74,0:11:17.99,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You're here, too, Kajiura-senpai?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.99,0:11:18.95,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.20,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Everyone on the student council's with us.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.62,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,What about you all?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.91,0:11:26.42,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah, we thought something like this\N would be nice for once.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.42,0:11:27.25,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.08,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.05,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's nice now and then.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.05,0:11:32.30,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Listen, you.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.76,0:11:36.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Tachibana, you look good in that.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.30,0:11:38.64,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.64,0:11:42.64,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,If I knew you were coming,\N I'd have worn something cuter.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.02,0:11:45.48,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what's going on here,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.48,0:11:48.90,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,with all the usual suspects lined up together?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.90,0:11:50.06,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Takigawa-kun?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.23,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.23,0:11:52.98,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey, Basacchi!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.53,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.24,0:11:59.28,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Quite the trend follower, \Ncoming here on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.78,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.28,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.28,0:12:06.04,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You think I'm here alone by choice?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:07.54,0:12:12.46,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I'm here to keep an eye on you all\N on behalf of the demon realm.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.46,0:12:16.92,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Whenever you all go somewhere, \NI need to be nearby.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.63,0:12:24.31,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,With that out of the way, the main attractions here \Nare the stupidly huge lazy river over there,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.31,0:12:26.31,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,and the nation's longest water slide!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.98,0:12:29.81,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You can eat at the food court\N on the west side!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.81,0:12:33.32,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I recommend the yakisoba \Npacked with ingredients!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.19,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You're a total trend follower.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.19,0:12:39.45,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's all have fun today!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.45,0:12:41.57,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.96,0:12:54.96,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.96,0:12:55.96,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.30,0:13:00.34,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Quick shots!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.23,0:13:15.07,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what should we enjoy next?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.07,0:13:16.86,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.44,0:13:20.36,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,By the way, where did Yuki and the others go?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.82,0:13:23.41,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,We got separated from them.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.95,Dialogue Italics,Mio,0,0,0,,Then that means we're alone right now?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.59,0:13:42.22,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What a nice mood!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.22,0:13:47.72,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Now, stop worrying about the others \Nwatching, and be more aggressive!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.93,0:13:50.68,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.39,0:13:52.90,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Y-You're in the way!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.90,0:13:53.60,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.10,0:13:55.06,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.73,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.57,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,Photography's prohibited here.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.57,0:14:03.36,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,N-No, I was just adding\N to my Mio-sama collection.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.95,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,You can come to the security room with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.95,0:14:09.29,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,No! Hold on!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.29,0:14:13.04,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:13.04,0:14:14.88,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh? A church?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.50,0:14:18.59,Dialogue,Woman,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.59,0:14:22.55,Dialogue,Priest,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's give a round of applause\N to celebrate their happy union!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.60,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Wow. A wedding ceremony?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.89,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,So they host those here, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.89,0:14:29.89,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.35,0:14:32.18,Dialogue Top,Crowd,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.43,0:14:32.85,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.81,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,One day, I hope I...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.36,0:14:42.24,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.20,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You two are here, too?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.91,0:14:47.78,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,It's such a coincidence to run into the two of you here!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.78,0:14:49.58,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Hasegawa-sensei.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.41,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're here for fun, too, Sensei?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.41,0:14:53.37,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.37,0:14:55.04,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,For future reference.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.33,0:14:56.58,Dialogue Top,Kids,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.17,0:14:59.04,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I need to be aware of recent trends,
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.92,0:15:03.05,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,in order to guide students as their teacher.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.72,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Toujou?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.01,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Your face is red. Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.01,0:15:09.39,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.10,Dialogue Top,Kids,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.06,Dialogue Top,Kids,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.14,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Whoa, look out!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.49,0:15:27.95,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You haven't forgotten your promise \Nabout this weekend, have you?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.08,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.87,0:15:32.33,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Then see you later, Toujou.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.41,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You, too, Naruse.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.88,0:15:44.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.84,0:15:52.06,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Getting my memory card confiscated is the worst!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.06,0:15:55.60,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What do they think\N someone's precious collection is?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.35,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Good thing I thought this might happen!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:59.52,0:16:00.48,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.48,0:16:02.61,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san? Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.90,0:16:07.15,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Is it the curse of the Master-Servant pact?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.16,0:16:10.20,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I need to relieve you quickly.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.20,0:16:13.49,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Is there anywhere we can hide?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.29,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Wait here for a moment.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.00,0:16:22.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Where can we avoid being seen?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.00,0:16:23.17,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.17,0:16:24.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.01,0:16:28.93,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,The curse is hitting her quite strongly.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.64,0:16:33.01,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,If you don't make Mio-sama submit\Nat once, she'll be in danger!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.23,0:16:39.23,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.69,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.48,Dialogue Top,Man,0,0,0,,This feels great!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:45.48,0:16:46.65,Dialogue Top,Woman,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.03,0:16:51.74,Dialogue Top,Woman,0,0,0,,That felt really great, didn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.74,0:16:52.82,Dialogue Top,Man,0,0,0,,Yeah, it did.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:55.95,0:16:58.00,Dialogue Top,Man,0,0,0,,This lazy river's great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.00,0:16:58.62,Dialogue Top,Woman,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio, we're doing it.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.00,0:17:01.83,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh? Here?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.83,0:17:02.67,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.67,0:17:06.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Everyone's focused on the pool, \Nso they won't notice us.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.00,0:17:07.05,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.05,0:17:10.05,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can to keep others\N from noticing us.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.05,0:17:12.18,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,So you do your best, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:15.47,0:17:16.43,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.10,0:17:19.35,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.35,0:17:20.69,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.27,0:17:22.81,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.69,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Huh? Naruse-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.86,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,You two are trying out this lazy river too?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.86,0:17:31.20,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,The lazy river feels great, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.53,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Right, Toujou-kun?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.53,0:17:34.62,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.62,0:17:36.58,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.12,0:17:39.71,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It'll be too late if we wait for them to go.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.71,0:17:40.75,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm starting.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.09,0:17:50.34,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Naruse-san? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.34,0:17:53.01,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.01,0:17:55.47,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.51,0:17:57.64,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,We're gonna fall!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.23,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.23,0:18:03.31,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down as much as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.31,0:18:06.23,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.85,0:18:45.23,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Naruse-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.15,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Toujou-kun?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.99,0:18:53.45,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,It's a wave!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.45,0:18:54.78,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,We're getting washed away!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.04,0:19:04.21,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,We're almost there, Mio!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:06.04,0:19:08.09,Dialogue Italics,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.80,0:19:21.22,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,That was so climactic!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.77,0:19:24.06,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,That was incredible, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.06,0:19:25.06,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.23,0:19:28.73,Dialogue,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, where are those two?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.00,0:19:53.26,Dialogue Flashback,Mio,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, I'm going to...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:02.31,0:20:04.35,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Ah, that was fun!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:04.35,0:20:06.52,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.52,0:20:09.52,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Though it was a bit embarrassing at the end.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.86,0:20:14.44,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,I can't believe I missed out\N on capturing such a sweet scene!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.44,0:20:16.70,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,I'm a failure of a succubus!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.70,0:20:17.78,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:19.07,0:20:20.20,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.78,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Next time, do it with me, as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.78,0:20:24.62,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,When you do, you can do something\N more incredible than you did with Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.79,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.33,0:20:29.54,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It was a miracle we didn't get caught this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.54,0:20:30.79,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.79,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,it was fun.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:32.79,0:20:33.67,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.26,0:20:36.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.09,0:20:38.93,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Let's go again, all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.51,0:20:40.30,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.56,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,And when we do, please wear\Nmy special selection of swimsuits!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.56,0:20:45.68,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No. I refuse.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.56,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.56,0:20:49.85,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.85,0:20:51.56,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I know they can't be good!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.57,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.07,0:20:57.57,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,I hope days like these can last forever.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.07,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Mio-sama?!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.08,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,That's—
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.33,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Stand back, Basara-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.87,0:21:08.08,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Wait, Zest.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.91,0:21:12.08,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's a sacred bird\N used by the hero village.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.08,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,The hero village?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.18,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.47,0:21:30.19,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,That was rather violent \Nfor an ordinary letter.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.19,0:21:31.10,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,They're orders.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.48,0:21:34.31,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yuki?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.86,0:21:36.73,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to return.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.11,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Both Kurumi and me.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.99,0:21:40.61,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Why would they order that?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.61,0:21:43.62,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Well, a lot of things have happened lately.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.62,0:21:47.16,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Maybe the elders have decided \Nthey can't overlook it anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.12,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,There's more to our orders.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:49.50,0:21:53.96,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,We're to bring Basara and \NMio with us on our return.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.96,0:21:55.21,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Us too?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.21,0:21:57.38,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,The hero village wants Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.63,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.63,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,I figured this would come.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:06.26,0:22:07.64,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.97,0:22:10.64,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,Seems that those elders of the hero village
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.64,0:22:13.40,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,have begun to make their move.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.40,0:22:14.65,Dialogue,Rukia,0,0,0,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.23,0:22:18.90,Dialogue,Rukia,0,0,0,,If necessary, I'll head there again.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.23,0:22:20.19,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.19,0:22:23.78,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,In fact, if we act carelessly, \Nwe might make things worse.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.07,0:22:27.03,Dialogue,Rukia,0,0,0,,However, we can't just leave this be.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:27.70,0:22:31.04,Dialogue,Rukia,0,0,0,,We don't know what kind of danger\N Maria might face.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:32.16,0:22:33.54,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.33,0:22:37.25,Dialogue,Shella,0,0,0,,Let's leave this in his hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.47,0:22:50.02,Dialogue,Three,0,0,0,,Take the necessary measures \Nif it comes down to it, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.60,0:22:55.06,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,What shall we do now, huh, Basacchi?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.40,0:22:58.15,Dialogue,Kurmi,0,0,0,,We can't do this!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:58.15,0:23:00.57,Dialogue,Kurmi,0,0,0,,If they’re asking us to bring Basara-niichan and Mio,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:00.57,0:23:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the elders are definitely plotting something!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:04.20,0:23:06.57,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Can't we just ignore the letter?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:07.91,0:23:11.08,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You're right. That would be one option.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:11.37,0:23:18.08,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,But considering our future,\N this isn't such a simple matter.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:19.67,0:23:22.55,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,The elders sense a threat.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:22.55,0:23:25.18,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,An equilibrium has been maintained\N ever since the war,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:25.18,0:23:27.59,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,but they're afraid that the balance \Nbetween heroes and demons
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.59,0:23:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will be toppled because of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:36.85,0:23:38.36,Dialogue Flashback,Maria,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean we can do this!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.36,0:23:41.40,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,We can't just bring Mio-sama to the hero village!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:41.40,0:23:42.86,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.15,0:23:46.11,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how dangerous \Nthat'd be for Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.11,0:23:50.12,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,The commotion in the demon realm \Nwas finally settled, and now—
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.49,0:23:53.62,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Just leave us alone already!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:56.00,0:23:57.04,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.25,0:24:00.38,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:00.38,0:24:04.88,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I'll protect you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:11.35,0:24:12.14,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:24.73,0:24:26.65,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.53,0:24:29.66,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,No, you're right on time.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:30.07,0:24:31.45,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You came for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:32.03,0:24:33.41,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:34.91,0:24:38.37,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm sure you're also busy\N with a bunch of things.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:38.37,0:24:41.38,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No! We made the promise \Na while back, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:41.92,0:24:45.42,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I let Mio and the others know\N ahead of time that I was heading out.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.01,0:24:48.43,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I see. In that case...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.93,0:24:55.27,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You're all mine until tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:06.07,0:25:06.94,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.61,0:25:11.32,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,W-Wow, this daikon's so thick and hard!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.32,0:25:13.45,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I bet it would taste good served as oden!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:14.20,0:25:18.46,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I should increase my cooking repertoire\N before Basara comes home.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.46,0:25:20.21,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to surprise him after all!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:20.96,0:25:22.21,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:23.96,0:25:25.71,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Oh, these look good, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.42,0:26:15.30,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think just the two of us should return?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:15.85,0:26:18.56,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,We just need to persuade the elders anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:19.85,0:26:22.56,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,If Basara decided that, then yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:23.39,0:26:25.44,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,But that's not the case.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:26.11,0:26:30.86,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara would never let us go alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:31.40,0:26:35.82,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,But if Basara-niichan returns \Nto the village, that means...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:43.92,0:26:46.38,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's too cruel.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:47.42,0:26:51.63,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Even so, we can't afford\N to not return in our current situation.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:00.10,0:27:02.60,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Hey, are you serious about that?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:05.02,0:27:07.61,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You sound like you've\Ngone back to the old you.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:08.23,0:27:12.44,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're hiding how you truly feel \Nwhile you suffer.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:12.44,0:27:16.82,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you wouldn't \Nunderstand our suffering.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:20.62,0:27:21.66,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Onee...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:24.50,0:27:25.87,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:29.67,0:27:32.55,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Good grief, how dedicated.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:35.47,0:27:36.13,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:37.47,0:27:38.60,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:38.60,0:27:39.93,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Thinking again?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:40.68,0:27:43.60,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Your head was in the clouds\N during our time on the train as well,
Dialogue: 99,0:27:44.27,0:27:48.19,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,but you promised to think only about me\N until tomorrow morning, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:48.19,0:27:49.77,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:50.57,0:27:52.15,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Is there something troubling you?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:52.15,0:27:53.61,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:53.61,0:27:56.70,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,There are several things that I\Nsuddenly need to make a decision on.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:57.28,0:27:59.57,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,And those things are important issues
Dialogue: 99,0:27:59.57,0:28:04.08,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,not just to you, but others\Nas well, aren't they?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:04.08,0:28:05.71,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.12,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Very much so.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:10.46,0:28:12.96,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll let you in\N on a good way to think about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:14.92,0:28:15.72,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:15.72,0:28:19.05,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,If you're in a dilemma because\Nthe problems aren't just your own,
Dialogue: 99,0:28:20.01,0:28:23.72,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,then think of their problems\N as if they were your own, as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:24.39,0:28:27.89,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Do that and you'll be able to decide\N what it is you want to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:27.89,0:28:28.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,But that would—
Dialogue: 99,0:28:28.81,0:28:34.73,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Of course, your decisions aren't necessarily \Ngoing to be good for every single person.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:35.49,0:28:36.99,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,That includes yourself, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:37.57,0:28:39.91,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,However, that's exactly why you need
Dialogue: 99,0:28:39.91,0:28:42.78,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,to steel yourself and have\Nan unwavering resolve.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:43.33,0:28:45.24,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Unwavering resolve?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:45.24,0:28:46.37,Dialogue,Kajiura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:47.00,0:28:48.50,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,That way, the decisions you make
Dialogue: 99,0:28:48.50,0:28:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will be ones both you and others \Ncan be proud of and won't regret.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:55.42,0:28:57.42,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Was that a little helpful?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:57.42,0:28:58.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:58.30,0:28:59.26,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:59.72,0:29:04.81,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,In that case, could you start focusing on me?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:04.81,0:29:06.77,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,From now until tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:13.69,0:29:14.65,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:34.46,0:29:36.59,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,No way, that...
Dialogue: 99,0:29:36.59,0:29:37.55,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:53.23,0:29:54.98,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.87,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,No, if you keep going...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:12.62,0:30:14.21,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:15.67,0:30:17.34,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I-It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:40.44,0:30:41.53,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:42.32,0:30:43.53,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:47.41,0:30:48.49,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Toujou!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:48.49,0:30:50.70,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:04.38,0:31:06.39,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yuki, do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:07.30,0:31:08.14,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:09.89,0:31:10.64,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Where's Yuki?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:11.14,0:31:13.39,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Onee said she was taking a shower.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:13.39,0:31:14.31,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:15.81,0:31:17.10,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:17.10,0:31:18.65,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:20.73,0:31:24.61,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Wow, everyone's so cute!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:24.61,0:31:26.28,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Wow, yes they are.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:26.28,0:31:27.49,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's a nice photo.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:27.49,0:31:28.91,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Everyone has a good smile.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:29.70,0:31:33.12,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's because the photo was taken\N before that incident happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:33.12,0:31:33.91,Dialogue,Three,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:34.21,0:31:37.92,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I think we were always smiling\N back in those days.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:38.33,0:31:41.42,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan, Onee, and me... all of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:41.96,0:31:43.21,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:43.21,0:31:45.59,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's a side of you all I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:45.59,0:31:46.55,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:49.76,0:31:50.81,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:50.81,0:31:52.18,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:00.06,0:32:00.94,Dialogue Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:08.70,0:32:11.28,Dialogue Flashback,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:15.29,0:32:16.21,Dialogue Flashback Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:17.96,0:32:21.21,Dialogue Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Yuki?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:21.21,0:32:22.46,Dialogue Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,Elder.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:22.46,0:32:26.97,Dialogue Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,Those two have been exiled \Nfrom the hero village.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:26.97,0:32:29.89,Dialogue Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,But you're going to live as a hero.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:29.89,0:32:32.97,Dialogue Flashback,Elder,0,0,0,,You will not be allowed\N to interact with them anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:37.94,0:32:39.06,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:40.65,0:32:43.02,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I couldn't chase after him.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:43.02,0:32:44.61,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I couldn't protect him.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:44.61,0:32:47.36,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Not during his most painful moments.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:49.95,0:32:53.37,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm sure Basara will comply \Nwith the Elders' orders,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:53.37,0:32:55.49,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,to protect us all,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:55.49,0:32:58.33,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,without regard for his own suffering.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:58.33,0:33:01.13,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I can't just tell Basara not \Nto go when he's like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:01.54,0:33:06.09,Dialogue Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,I don't have any right to say that\N when I couldn't say anything back then.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:06.09,0:33:08.22,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Why're you worrying about this\N all on your own?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:11.84,0:33:12.51,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:13.14,0:33:17.39,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You've been thinking of Basara\N both then and now,
Dialogue: 99,0:33:17.39,0:33:20.02,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,but you're putting a lid on those feelings?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:20.77,0:33:23.02,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're really dumb.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:24.90,0:33:27.61,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's fine. You can be more honest.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:27.61,0:33:28.40,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:29.24,0:33:32.91,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I know you all have a regret\N from your past you can't erase.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:32.91,0:33:38.37,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I can't just casually claim to understand \Nhow much you've suffered because of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:38.37,0:33:40.37,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,But still, I want you to tell me.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:40.37,0:33:42.88,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to hear how you truly feel.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:42.88,0:33:43.92,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:44.29,0:33:48.13,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You saved me many times during\Nour time in the demon realm, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:48.13,0:33:49.92,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You and Kurumi-chan both did.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:50.80,0:33:52.93,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,So it's my turn now.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:00.27,0:34:02.98,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,This is your homeland, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:04.73,0:34:08.40,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to go to the hero village.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:08.73,0:34:09.61,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:09.61,0:34:11.03,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Yuki.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:11.03,0:34:12.91,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Don't bear this all on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:12.91,0:34:14.62,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:15.16,0:34:18.04,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,If anything happens to you, then I'd—
Dialogue: 99,0:34:20.45,0:34:24.75,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to help Basara, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:27.55,0:34:29.13,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:29.13,0:34:34.84,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I want to know what suffering you, \NKurumi-chan, and Basara have been carrying.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.59,0:34:40.22,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I believe I have to help the three of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:40.22,0:34:41.31,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:41.31,0:34:46.19,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,After all, Basara's your most\Nprecious childhood friend.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:46.19,0:34:51.19,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,And Basara's the most precious\NOnii-chan in the world to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:56.91,0:35:02.54,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,The truth is, I don't want \Nto see Basara suffer anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:02.54,0:35:04.58,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:05.21,0:35:09.63,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,If that destiny is unavoidable, \Nthen let's stand against it together.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:10.13,0:35:13.76,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,That way we can all save Basara\N together this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:13.76,0:35:14.51,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:38.41,0:35:41.66,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Sorry for slipping into your mind\N without permission.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:42.20,0:35:43.50,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Maria's doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:43.91,0:35:45.00,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:45.00,0:35:48.00,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I did it because I wanted to have \Na proper talk with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:48.00,0:35:49.75,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,One without hiding anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:51.63,0:35:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so pushy.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:54.55,0:35:59.14,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Jeez. With the two of them that amped up,\N we have no choice but to go.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:09.15,0:36:10.61,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:10.61,0:36:13.19,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You should do as you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:13.78,0:36:16.32,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,But please don't forget this:
Dialogue: 99,0:36:16.32,0:36:18.66,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,you have me on your side.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:19.16,0:36:21.91,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I'll grant you some of my power.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:21.91,0:36:25.16,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,For you, and for the future of you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:32.13,0:36:35.51,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Basara, no matter what happens...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:36.09,0:36:37.84,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:59.99,0:37:01.62,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:02.37,0:37:04.12,Dialogue,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,Good morning, Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:04.91,0:37:06.62,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:27.22,0:37:29.77,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,"An unwavering resolve," huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:31.06,0:37:34.57,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,It's true that we can't avoid \Nreturning to the hero village
Dialogue: 99,0:37:34.57,0:37:37.32,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,if we want to protect our future.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:37.32,0:37:38.53,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:52.50,0:37:54.25,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Am I afraid?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:54.25,0:37:56.00,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Of returning there?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:56.59,0:37:59.22,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Of facing my past?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:01.22,0:38:02.05,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:02.05,0:38:04.47,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You finally returned.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:05.64,0:38:07.22,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:08.02,0:38:08.72,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:14.36,0:38:16.23,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Looks good!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.98,0:38:19.61,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you treat me.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:19.61,0:38:22.78,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Surprised you can say that\N after planning on it from the start.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:22.78,0:38:23.74,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:23.74,0:38:26.49,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Oh, everything between these two pieces is mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:26.95,0:38:30.25,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,So, what're you going to do about the hero village?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:31.54,0:38:33.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:33.29,0:38:34.25,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:34.25,0:38:37.04,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Do you think we don't know\N anything about that?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:40.59,0:38:44.05,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,This is a matter between\Nmembers of the hero clan.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.05,0:38:46.26,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with you demons.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:46.26,0:38:49.56,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We'll protect our daily life\N with our own hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:50.27,0:38:53.69,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Oh, this one's grilled up good.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:54.77,0:38:56.77,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I appreciate the nice spirit,
Dialogue: 99,0:38:57.19,0:38:59.73,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,but things are finally getting settled \Nbetween the moderate faction
Dialogue: 99,0:38:59.73,0:39:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the reigning demon-lord faction.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:04.24,0:39:08.70,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,If you get all emotional and act on your own
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.70,0:39:11.62,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,at a time like this, there'll be a lot of trouble for us.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:15.83,0:39:19.42,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Basacchi, I think you have\Nthe wrong impression here.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:19.42,0:39:24.55,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I'm here to keep an eye on you,\N not be your best friend.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:25.51,0:39:26.55,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:26.55,0:39:28.85,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Then you understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:28.85,0:39:31.89,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,We're just leaving Naruse Mio in your care.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:31.89,0:39:36.06,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,If she's put in danger,\N then we'll eliminate that threat.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:36.06,0:39:39.57,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,We'll destroy your hometown if necessary,
Dialogue: 99,0:39:42.57,0:39:47.78,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,and it's none of our concern if you\Nall lose this meager happiness of yours.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:50.16,0:39:52.29,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,We'll erase them completely.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:52.29,0:39:54.25,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,That's my job, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:56.00,0:39:59.34,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Overcooked meat just isn't worth eating.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:59.34,0:40:00.75,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Are you serious about that?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:00.75,0:40:02.00,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:02.00,0:40:03.88,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You seriously got to be careful.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:04.84,0:40:06.09,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:07.51,0:40:09.14,Dialogue,Two,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:11.76,0:40:13.72,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,We made a lot.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:14.39,0:40:16.81,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,We might have gone a bit overboard.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:16.81,0:40:17.94,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:17.94,0:40:19.65,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara's coming home.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:20.40,0:40:23.78,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Still, Basara-sama's late.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:31.62,0:40:32.53,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:33.20,0:40:38.25,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,We're like wives waiting for our husband.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:39.83,0:40:41.67,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if we were.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:42.42,0:40:45.05,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You're getting ahead of yourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:45.05,0:40:46.59,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,We haven't even married him yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:46.92,0:40:50.93,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Good idea! Let's do that!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:51.22,0:40:52.43,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:02.86,0:41:05.23,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Has to be here, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:05.23,0:41:06.32,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:06.61,0:41:09.03,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,This is the second time we've fought, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:09.03,0:41:10.95,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No, the third.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:10.95,0:41:12.37,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.70,0:41:20.29,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Now no one will interfere.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:20.29,0:41:21.50,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:21.50,0:41:22.46,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:07.63,0:42:08.84,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:08.84,0:42:13.30,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I won't let even you lay a hand\N on our peaceful lives or our future!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:13.68,0:42:16.51,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,So that's your will? Your pride?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:16.51,0:42:19.52,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,However, can you really protect that
Dialogue: 99,0:42:19.52,0:42:22.56,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,when you're a coward \Ntrembling at your own past?!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:27.90,0:42:29.07,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:48.92,0:42:49.92,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:49.92,0:42:52.80,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,The hero village?!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:56.68,0:42:58.47,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,See? Look at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:03.69,0:43:05.85,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You won't let anyone lay a hand on it?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:05.85,0:43:08.36,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Don't go spouting crap you can't back up!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:08.36,0:43:11.03,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,The only reason you've survived\N this long is that
Dialogue: 99,0:43:11.03,0:43:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your clever tricks\N miraculously happened to work out!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:15.78,0:43:17.03,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:25.12,0:43:28.79,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,You should learn your place already!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:33.88,0:43:35.47,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,That's it, then?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:46.35,0:43:49.73,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Nice facing yourself for once, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:51.11,0:43:52.61,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.36,0:43:55.57,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:01.16,0:44:03.37,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I can't use Banishing Shift?!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:16.01,0:44:17.18,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:17.18,0:44:19.51,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Have your skills gone dull\N from all that peace?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:19.85,0:44:24.02,Dialogue Italics,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Or is something happening within Basacchi?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:32.40,0:44:36.03,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Well, doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:01.43,0:45:02.22,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:02.22,0:45:04.01,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Done already?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:04.01,0:45:05.72,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:05.72,0:45:08.81,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Guess I'll deliver the finishing blow now.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:12.56,0:45:17.57,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We'll take Naruse \Nand the others into our care.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:19.36,0:45:20.57,Dialogue Flashback,Mio,0,0,0,,Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:30.75,0:45:31.83,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:31.83,0:45:38.84,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You're right. It might be a miracle\N that we've made it through everything so far.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:38.84,0:45:41.68,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We borrowed power from\Na lot of different people, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:41.68,0:45:44.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:45.68,0:45:49.14,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We never gave up,\N no matter what happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:49.14,0:45:51.40,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We had faith in ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:51.40,0:45:53.11,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,And we fought!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:53.48,0:45:57.11,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,That's why we're here right now!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:00.74,0:46:02.11,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:20.13,0:46:21.01,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:25.01,0:46:29.52,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm going to personally protect their smiles,\N no matter what!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:50.50,0:46:54.46,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I have never once given up on our future!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:54.46,0:46:58.09,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa!
Dialogue: 99,0:47:15.81,0:47:17.31,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:17.31,0:47:23.36,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Looks like you haven't slacked off just because\N the demon problems are settling down.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:25.07,0:47:26.49,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Takigawa.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:26.49,0:47:28.24,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:28.24,0:47:31.75,Dialogue,Takigawa,0,0,0,,I'll keep watching to see how\Nfar that will of yours can go.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:32.54,0:47:33.75,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,That guy...
Dialogue: 99,0:47:41.63,0:47:42.51,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:46.05,0:47:47.01,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:48.22,0:47:49.60,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:51.31,0:47:53.02,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you...
Dialogue: 99,0:47:53.43,0:47:55.52,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Well? Surprised?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:57.90,0:48:00.40,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:01.32,0:48:02.40,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:02.40,0:48:05.40,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,No, you all look pretty.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:05.40,0:48:06.66,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Really pretty.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:10.66,0:48:15.12,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I was fine, but everyone insisted.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:15.12,0:48:19.50,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Oh ho? You were pretty\Ninto this, too, Kurumi-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:19.50,0:48:23.17,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,You were saying,\N "I'll finally get to be Basara-niichan's bride!"
Dialogue: 99,0:48:23.42,0:48:25.42,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh? Then you mean these are...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:25.42,0:48:26.22,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:26.22,0:48:30.72,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Maria suggested we should\Nall become your brides,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:30.72,0:48:33.89,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,as a way to strengthen\Nour bonds as your family.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:33.89,0:48:35.93,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's a great idea?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:35.93,0:48:41.69,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,The Master-Servant pact makes everyone\Nstronger when their bonds are stronger!
Dialogue: 99,0:48:42.07,0:48:46.19,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Doing this will make all of us even stronger!
Dialogue: 99,0:48:46.65,0:48:49.70,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,With this, we should be fine\N even if we do return to the village.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:51.45,0:48:52.95,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,You all...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:53.58,0:48:54.74,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:54.74,0:48:58.58,Dialogue,Officer,0,0,0,,I knew it. You were planning on going \Nto the hero village all by yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:58.58,0:48:59.21,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:59.50,0:49:02.38,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,The other day you said,
Dialogue: 99,0:49:02.88,0:49:07.05,Dialogue Flashback,Basara,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,430)}No matter what happens, I'll protect you all.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:07.42,0:49:10.01,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Not "we," but "I."
Dialogue: 99,0:49:10.01,0:49:13.93,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,So I thought that might be so.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:15.89,0:49:17.43,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:17.77,0:49:21.44,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,You always, always go into\Nthe most danger all by yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:21.44,0:49:24.98,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Are we that bad?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:27.36,0:49:29.74,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Do you have that little faith in us?!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:34.53,0:49:35.66,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:35.66,0:49:37.83,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio, your curse...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:37.83,0:49:40.12,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Of course it would.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:40.12,0:49:43.34,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No matter how much I may be thinking of you,
Dialogue: 99,0:49:43.34,0:49:47.71,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,my desire to go with you is still selfish.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:48.09,0:49:51.09,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,But I need to say it.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:51.09,0:49:55.22,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you'll go on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:55.76,0:50:02.06,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,The hero village probably believes\N I'm the root of their current problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:02.06,0:50:04.06,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,So I should just go by myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:04.86,0:50:06.11,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,If I do...
Dialogue: 99,0:50:06.11,0:50:11.07,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Then maybe Kurumi, \N Mio, and I can avoid harm.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:11.07,0:50:14.16,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're right that that is a possibility.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:14.16,0:50:17.91,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,But that's your own selfish belief.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:17.91,0:50:20.91,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll never let you do that.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:24.46,0:50:25.13,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yuki?!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:25.54,0:50:27.96,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Why're you being this rash?!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:27.96,0:50:30.30,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:30.30,0:50:33.51,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Because this is about you!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:33.51,0:50:36.30,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Onee and Mio are both serious about this.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:36.30,0:50:39.27,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,No, it's not just those two.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:39.72,0:50:44.52,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan, this is how\N all five of us feel!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:46.65,0:50:48.78,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria. Kurumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:49.36,0:50:55.28,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Basara-sama, just as you\Ntreasure us above all else,
Dialogue: 99,0:50:55.28,0:50:58.87,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,we treasure you, as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:58.87,0:51:02.41,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Even if you tell us "no," we won't give up.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:02.41,0:51:06.17,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,We'll follow you, even if it\Nmeans disobeying your orders!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:06.17,0:51:13.43,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,So please forgive our selfish desire\N to accompany you.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:17.68,0:51:18.76,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Zest?!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:18.76,0:51:20.68,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Basara,
Dialogue: 99,0:51:21.10,0:51:24.10,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,make us submit.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:24.10,0:51:27.15,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Make us stronger.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:27.77,0:51:30.19,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Until you can rest assured.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:31.11,0:51:32.57,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 99,0:51:32.94,0:51:37.07,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Kurumi-san and I will help you, of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:37.07,0:51:38.58,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Right, Kurumi-san?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:47.38,0:51:50.71,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Onii-chan, do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:58.22,0:51:59.47,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:00.85,0:52:01.77,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:03.89,0:52:04.81,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:07.27,0:52:08.23,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Kurumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:10.11,0:52:11.36,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:13.53,0:52:14.44,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Zest.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:14.44,0:52:15.61,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Basara-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:17.70,0:52:20.74,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,I'll relieve you now.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:35.51,0:52:38.34,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara, me, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:38.34,0:52:40.01,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:46.06,0:52:49.15,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Basara, me, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:54.78,0:52:57.65,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan, me, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:57.65,0:53:01.28,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,I'll be your partner before Basara-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:01.28,0:53:02.41,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Maria?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:05.04,0:53:07.29,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Oh, Maria!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:21.43,0:53:25.01,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Basara-niichan, does it feel good?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:25.01,0:53:27.56,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Am I doing it properly?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:27.81,0:53:29.31,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,You're doing well,
Dialogue: 99,0:53:30.31,0:53:31.44,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Kurumi-san.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:36.19,0:53:38.32,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,You shouldn't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:42.12,0:53:47.33,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,This is our wedding, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:47.91,0:53:50.58,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:50.58,0:53:54.63,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,In that case, I have this for us!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:04.30,0:54:06.68,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Maria, what's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:07.02,0:54:10.94,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Instead of a rice shower, \Nit's an aphrodisiac shower!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:10.94,0:54:14.44,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,It's to celebrate overcoming \Nthe Succubus's baptism!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:14.69,0:54:17.73,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,J-Jeez, Maria!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:21.91,0:54:24.62,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:24.62,0:54:26.33,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm yearning for it!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:26.66,0:54:28.12,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:29.08,0:54:32.12,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Come to me, Basara-niichan!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:32.83,0:54:34.21,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Basara-sama!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:36.54,0:54:38.00,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Basara-san!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:40.26,0:54:42.38,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah. Here I go.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:43.74,0:55:47.24,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm never letting you go.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:49.95,0:55:51.24,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:52.58,0:55:55.83,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,We are family, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:00.13,0:56:00.96,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:34.04,0:56:35.20,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:35.20,0:56:36.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:36.66,0:56:38.42,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep us waiting?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:38.42,0:56:39.92,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,It's an important day.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:39.92,0:56:42.00,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:44.92,0:56:45.51,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:45.92,0:56:48.72,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,We're perfectly packed now!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:48.72,0:56:51.22,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,Are you sure\N that isn't a bit too big for you?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:54.68,0:56:56.27,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:56.89,0:56:58.64,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,There, perfect!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:58.64,0:56:59.52,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:59.85,0:57:01.65,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:02.23,0:57:03.78,Dialogue,Yuki,0,0,0,,Did you make all these?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:04.28,0:57:07.20,Dialogue,Zest,0,0,0,,If you had said something,\NI would have made them.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:07.20,0:57:08.11,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:08.11,0:57:11.03,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I was in charge of breakfast \Nthis morning, anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:11.03,0:57:13.41,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Well? Perfect, aren't they?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:13.41,0:57:16.20,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,They look really normal, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:16.20,0:57:19.04,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I would have made character bento.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:20.00,0:57:21.04,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:27.63,0:57:29.63,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's good!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:29.63,0:57:30.55,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:30.80,0:57:32.35,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll try some, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:32.35,0:57:33.68,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:33.68,0:57:36.64,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I was hungry!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:36.64,0:57:37.93,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:37.93,0:57:40.81,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,There's no point to the bento\N if you eat them here!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:40.81,0:57:43.56,Dialogue,Maria,0,0,0,,Mio-sama, so stingy!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:44.57,0:57:46.57,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's my share, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:46.57,0:57:49.15,Dialogue,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Mio, what's wrong with a little bit?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:49.15,0:57:51.49,Dialogue,Mio,0,0,0,,I told you "no"!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:56.66,0:57:57.83,Dialogue,Basara,0,0,0,,It's about time to head out.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:58.87,0:57:59.79,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:19.10,0:58:21.35,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Don't look back at the past.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:21.35,0:58:22.44,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,Look toward tomorrow,
Dialogue: 99,0:58:22.44,0:58:23.73,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,toward hope,
Dialogue: 99,0:58:23.73,0:58:24.81,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,toward the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:25.61,0:58:27.86,Dialogue Italics,Basara,0,0,0,,We're going to seize it.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:11.32,0:59:13.82,Dialogue,Hero,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get here, Basara.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:14.32,0:59:19.20,Dialogue,Hero,0,0,0,,The immutable past\N is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.20,0:59:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
